          "text": "⟪ወይፀርፉ ፡ ላዕለ ፡ ፍኖተ ፡ ጽድቅ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕገ ፡ ጽድቅ ፡ ወንጌልን። አንድም ፡ ሕገ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ክርስቶስ ፡ ወንጌልን ፡ ይነቅፋሉ ። ሐተታ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጽድቅ ፡ አለው ፡ በግብሩ ፡ ፪ ፡ ጢሞ ፡ ፬ ፥",
