          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አትረፈ ፡ ምስለ ፡ ኖኅ ፡ ስማኒተ ፡ ነፍሰ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምስለ ፡ ኖኅ ፡ ብለህ ፡ (ግጠም) ፡ ከኖኅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጋራ ፡ ስምንት ፡ ሰዎች ፡ አስቀረ ፡ እንጅ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ዘዐቀባ ፡ ለጽድቅ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጽድቅን ፡ ከጠበቃት ፡ ከኖኅ ፡ ጋራ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ከመ ፡ ይኩን ፡ ዜናዌ ፡ በጽድቅ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በ ፡ በግዕዝ ፡ ቦታ ፡ የገባ ፡ ነው ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሃይማኖትን ፡ ያስተምር ፡ ዘንድ ። ሐተታ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለማን ፡ ያስተምራል ፡ ቢሉ ፡ ለልጆቹ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልጆቹማ ፡ ተምረው ፡ አይደለም ፡ የዳኑ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቢሉ ፡ ለሌላው። አንድም ፡ አቤልሰ ፡ ኮነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይትናገር ፡ በዜና ፡ እንዲል ፡ ነገሩ ፡ ጽንፍ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እስከ ፡ ጽንፍ ፡ ደርሷል ፡ እስከ ፡ ምጽአት፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሲያያዝ ፡ ሲነገር ፡ ይኖራልና ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወለባዕዳንሰ ፡ ሰብእ ፡ ረሲዓን ፡ ፈነወ ፡ አይኀ ፡ ላዕ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሌሆሙ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሰብአ ፡ ትካት ፡ ግን ፡ ማየ ፡ ድምሳሴን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማየ ፡ ሥራዌን ፡ አዘዘባቸው ፡ ም ፡ ፫ ፥ ፮ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘፍጥ ፡ ፯ ፥ ፲፯ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": "፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፮ ፤ ⟪ወለአህጉረ ፡ ሰዶምኒ ፡ ወገሞራ ፡ አውዐዮን ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወገፍትኦን ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰዶም ፡ ገሞራ ፡ አዳማ ፡ ሱባማ ፡ ሲባዮ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንንም ፡ እንደ ፡ መቅሎ፡ቆላቸው ፥ እንደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዓሣ ፡ ገለበጣቸው ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወከመዝ ፡ ኰነኖሙ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲህ ፡ ፈረደባቸው ። አንድም ፡ እያየ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነውና ፡ የሚጽፍ ፡ እንዲህ ፡ ፈረደባቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይላል ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአርአያ ፡ ረሰዮሙ ፡ ለእለ ፡ በደኃሪ ፡ መዋዕል ፡ ለኃ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጥአን ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኋላ ፡ ዘመን ፡ ለሚነሡ ፡ ኃጥአን ፡ አብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነት ፡ አደረጋቸው ። ሐተታ ፡ አብነት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይሁኑ ፡ ብሎስ ፡ አያጠፋም ፡ ከሆነ ፡ ብሎ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲህ ፡ አለ ፥ ዘፍጥ ፡ ፲፱ ፥ ፳፬ ። ዕብ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፩ ፥ ፯ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": "፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፯ ፤ ⟪ወለጻድቅሰ ፡ ሎጥ ፡ ዘይትገፋዕ ፡ እምእለ ፡ ይኤ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሱ ፡ በምግባረ ፡ ዝሙቶሙ ፥ አድኀኖ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘይትገፋዕ ፡ እምእለ ፡ ይኤብሱ ፥ አድ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኀኖ ፡ እምእለ ፡ ይኤብሱ ፡ ብለህ ፡ ግጠም ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዝሙትን ፡ በመሥራት ፡ ከሚበድሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰዎች ፡ የሚበደል ፡ ሎጥን ፡ ግን ፡ ከሚበ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድሉ ፡ ሰዎች ፡ ለይቶ ፡ አዳነው ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእንዘ ፡ ይሬኢ ፡ ወይሰምዕ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጻድቅ ፡ ሎጥ ፡ ይህን ፡ ሲያይ ፡ ሲሰማ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አዳነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": "፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፰ ፤ ⟪ወኅዱር ፡ ምስሌሆሙ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሳቸው ፡ ጋራ ፡ ሲኖር ፡ አዳነው ፥ ወዕ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለተ ፡ እምዕለት ፡ ማንሻ ። አንድም ፡ ከሳ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቸው ፡ ጋራ ፡ ሲኖር ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወዕለተ ፡ እምዕለት ፡ የኤዕርዋ ፡ ለነፍሱ ፡ ጻድቅት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በእኩየ ፡ ምግባሮሙ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከቀን ፡ በቀን ፡ እያሉ ፡ ጻድቅት ፡ ሰውነ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቱን ፡ በክፉ ፡ ግብራቸው ፡ ያስጨንቋት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነበር ፤ ብትመስል ፡ እኛን ፡ ምሰል ፡ ባት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መስል ፡ ከሀገራችን ፡ ንቀል ፡ እያሉ ፥ መዝ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፻፲፱ ፥ ፻፶፰ ። ሕዝ ፡ ፱ ፥ ፬ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": "፱",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፱ ፤ ⟪ናሁኬ ፡ አእመርነ ፡ ከመ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ ይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ክል ፡ አድኀኖቶሙ ፡ እምነ ፡ መንሱት ፡ ለጻድቃን ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንኪያስ ፡ ወዳጆቹ ፡ ጻድቃንን ፡ እግዚአ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሔር ፡ ከመከራው ፡ ሁሉ ፡ እንዲያድና",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቸው ፡ አወቅነ ፡ (እናውቃለን ፡ ቢል ፡ አ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንድ ፡ ነው) ፥ ሠራዒ ፡ መጋቢ ፡ ከሌለ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኖኅን ፡ ከድምሳሴ ፥ ሎጥን ፡ ከግፍታኤ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማን ፡ አዳነ ፡ ለማለት ፡ እንዲህ ፡ አለ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
